{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_19\">Problem 19</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 19\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e81bcdae6b9f3547966bc7bef372197bef6cca8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />, the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are each decreased <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />; the value of the expression is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/1/d81eeabe0dcf829dd74e1edfb6e054a13c383469.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{decreased } 50\\% \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{decreased }75\\%\\\\  \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{decreased }\\frac{37}{64}\\text{ of its value}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{decreased }\\frac{27}{64}\\text{ of its value}\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"466\" height=\"74\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are decreased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> become <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/8/4b8422ec646e1e3abac6edc8deea382fe7aae800.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"23\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/b/61b07a410091303c8b333ab526b2697d7912871b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> respectively.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e81bcdae6b9f3547966bc7bef372197bef6cca8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> becomes \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/5/0650c112b941b883a76136075e0e42b4896d67a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{3}{4}x\\right)\\left(\\frac{3}{4}y\\right)^2 = \\frac{27}{64}xy^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"185\" height=\"48\" />, so it decreases by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab2b11eaf008362a31719ae9718d7377c902495.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy^2 - \\frac{27}{64}xy^2 = \\frac{37}{64}xy^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"175\" height=\"38\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e81bcdae6b9f3547966bc7bef372197bef6cca8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/f/e4f7b5e8b172c8710e393c0bf9037f6b44a2d663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{decreased }\\frac{37}{64}\\text{ of its value}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"229\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/